   "design": "Frames carry barcodes, so each sale books stock out in the shop system ({OPS_SYSTEM}) and the stock list is not kept in a spreadsheet; the day's sales report replaces totalling receipts. Claims are built from the sale, the prescription and the customer's insurance details in the shop system. Once checked, claims for insurers that take standard electronic claims, about 70%, go out as messages; the rest are still entered in insurers' portals. Till takings and the bank feed flow into the bookkeeping ({ERP}) with rules per expense type, and the optician books only exceptions.",
   "previous_blocker": "Stock, sales and books were kept in spreadsheets and claims typed per insurer.",
   "enabler_now": "Shop systems book stock by sale and send standard insurer claims.",
   "still_hard": "Insurers with their own portals still need typing.",
   "human_edge": "Explaining to a customer what their insurer will pay.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
   },
   "altitude": "The optician checks claims and books instead of typing them.",
   "reach": [
    {
     "role": "insurers",
     "task": "Pay claims",
     "learn": "Whether claims arrive complete."
    }
   ],
   "build_days": {
    "coding": "0",
    "integration": "1-2",
    "testing_rollout": "0-1",
    "consent_and_access": "0"
   },
   "run_cost": "low",
   "evidence": [
    {
     "claim": "Optical shop systems can book stock by sale and send standard electronic claims to insurers.",
     "grade": "E1",
     "source": "model knowledge",
     "kind": "capability"
    },
    {
     "claim": "Prescriptions and insurance details are health data, special category under the GDPR.",
     "grade": "E1",
     "source": "[S24]",
     "kind": "legal"
    }
   ],
   "assumptions": [
    "Boundary: from the day's sales to the books updated; annual accounts are outside.",
    "Input contract: frames barcoded and insurer links set up; fallback is spreadsheets and portals.",
    "Scenario: about 70% of claims go to insurers that take standard electronic claims.",
    "The optician checks every claim before it goes."
   ],
   "unknowns": [
